<h4 class="byline">Who is Michael Brick, and when did he get so good?</h4>

<p>

<a href="http://query.nytimes.com/search/query?ppds=bylL&v1=MICHAEL%20BRICK&fdq=19960101&td=sysdate&sort=newest&ac=MICHAEL%20BRICK&inline=nyt-per">He</a> keeps cranking out <a href="http://www.nytimes.com/2005/07/21/nyregion/21brownout.html?pagewanted=print">stuff like this:</a><br />
<br />
