Stumbled across <a href="http://store.mcsweeneys.net/index.cfm/fuseaction/catalog.detail/object_id/8A28EC24-ECCF-4DDF-AA24-F5DE72568D5B/TheBelieverBookofWritersTalkingtoWriters.cfm">The Believer Book of Writers Talking to Writers</a>. Looks pretty good.<br />
<br />
From the pitch:<br />
<br />
Ian McEwan: "The dream, surely, that we all have, is to write this beautiful paragraph that actually is describing something but at the same time in another voice is writing a commentary on its own creation, without having to be a story about a writer."<br />
<br />
