<p>

Happy Independence Day everyone. I'm heading out of town for the weekend, so here are a few to keep you busy.<br />
<br />
<a href="http://www.nytimes.com/2006/06/30/us/30road.html?_r=1&oref=slogin">Dan Barry from Cameron, La</a>, <a href="http://www.sptimes.com/2006/06/30/Floridian/The_view_from_above__.shtml">Lane DeGregory on the reality of a development</a>; <a href="http://www.sptimes.com/2006/06/26/Hernando/Fireworks_lover_in_tr.shtml">Kruse with a guy born on the Fourth Of July</a>, and, from George Madden, my good friend in Oklahoma City, <a href="http://select.nytimes.com/gst/abstract.html?res=F70E17FD3B550C768DDDAF0894DE404482">David Brooks and Changing Bedfellows</a>.<br />
