<p>

Read Brady Dennis' <a href="http://www.sptimes.com/2006/09/07/Floridian/Lessons_for_life.shtml">story</a>: The stares begin each time he approaches the stage, his hand searching for the familiar touch of the keyboard. He never knows how many pairs of eyes are focused on him, watching, waiting.<br />
<br />
