<br />
They were, anyway, until the old soldier showed up.<br />
<br />
<a href="http://www.sptimes.com/2006/12/01/Pasco/New_Port_Richey__Trou.shtml">Erin</a>: He punched her, pulled her hair, scratched her face. Sometimes she came to work with black eyes. Sometimes co-workers followed her home to make sure he wasn't waiting for her.
