�Mind your tongue,� the crew cut sitting on the stool said. �We civilized people here. We don�t allow anybody talkin� like that in front of our women.� He looked around. The one waitress was at the stove in the kitchen behind the counter. �You damnyankees come down here and think you can talk the way you please in front of our women. Well, jes� remember we civilized here.�<br />
