<br />
If inclined, the workers could step into a trashed old tavern, there before their great-grandfathers were born, or peruse the peeling tin ceiling of an ancient shop across the street. But with appearances to maintain, they whack that purple-flowered plant rising near the lobby of Maxine&#8217;s clothing store, empty.<br />
<br />
