<br />
<i>In 1992, a young man from a well-to-do family hitchhiked to Alaska and walked alone into the wilderness north of Mt. McKinley. His name was Christopher Johnson McCandless. He had given $25,000 in savings to charity, abandonded his car and most of his posessions, burned all of the cash in his wallet, and invented a new life for himself. Four months later, his decomposed body was found by a moose hunter ...</i><br />
<br />
Sean Penn directs. Krakauer evidently had a hand in writing the screenplay. Vince Vaughn co-stars. Here's <a href="http://www.eonline.com/movies/reelgirl/detail/index.jsp?uuid=0ee06b1b-7f80-4e88-8821-b36ce23ac10d">the movie trailer</a>.
