<a href="http://gangrey.com/1157">
<h2 class="design">Sunday Reading</h2></a>


<p>

<b>Meg Laughlin and Don Morris</b>: <a href="http://www.sptimes.com/2007/08/26/State/A_new_look_at_a_10_ye.shtml">Seeds of doubt</a>. <br />
<br />
<b>Kurt Streeter</b>: <a href="http://www.latimes.com/news/local/la-me-sami26aug26,0,7565324.story?coll=la-home-local">A girl, and injury, a will to recover</a>. <br />
<br />
