<br />
Sit down, she told him. <br />
<br />
"Jonathan was killed." <br />
<br />
Matthew just sat. He asked how. Then he was quiet for a long time. <br />
<br />
Somehow he got dressed, got into his car and headed up I-275 to Safety Harbor, to the house where he and Jonathan and the other brothers grew up. <br />
<br />
Jonathan and Matt were stepbrothers, less than a year apart. They'd shared a room, slept 10 feet apart. They had pretend sword fights. Jonathan went to the Army. Matt went to college. Now Pfc. Jonathan Michael Rossi was dead in Baghdad from a single bullet to the base of the skull. </i>
