Arturo&#8217;s story became all tangled up in Cowboy and Vivian&#8217;s this summer. Their paths crossed here in a hidden corner of the world along the Hudson River in the City of Newburgh. If they had not met, it&#8217;s very likely no one outside that world would have known Arturo&#8217;s name.<br />
