He dresses in his dark blue color guard uniform. He wears his American Legion cap; he's the commander of Post 123. His uniform contains a blue star flag pin, indicating that he had a loved one serving in the Iraq war, and a gold star pin, indicating that the loved one had been killed in action.<br />
