He wanted this ring to be perfect. After three failed engagements, this one had to work. <br />
<br />
He peered again at the 5/8-carat stone, fixated on that flaw. "It looks like an angel," he remembers telling the sales clerk. "Hold it this way, and she's flying. Tip it down, and &#8212; look &#8212; she's praying." 
