<p>

From Dan Stockman: You think the folks on Gangrey could offer a critique? I faced a lot of challenges - the story was six years old, parts of it had been previously reported elsewhere, though never here, etc. I guess I'm wondering if the mix of narrative and traditional reporting worked, or if people would have done things differently? I tried several different approaches, but this was the only one that felt right. Maybe others have ideas I didn't think of.<br />
<br />
