<p>

Helen Ubinas has returned to the <i>Hartford Courant</i> after a fellowship. This is <a href="http://www.courant.com/community/news/hfd/hc-hubinas0813.artaug13,0,436053.column">her first column back</a> (thanks, Vanessa): He just fell. And at first, the people standing around the little boy didn't think the unrelenting popping noises had anything to do with him collapsing onto the pavement like a rag doll.<br />
