<a href="http://gangrey.com/1787/img_Aug_19_2008_01_25?display=medium"><img src="http://gangrey.com/1787/img_Aug_19_2008_01_25?display=xsmall" alt="img_Aug_19_2008_01_25" height="200" width="124" border="0" style="border: 0px; float: left; margin-right: 1em; margin-bottom: .5em; padding: 0px;" /></a>
<a href="http://www.washingtonpost.com/wp-dyn/content/article/2008/08/18/AR2008081802481.html?hpid=topnews">Hank Stuever</a>: America's seeing monsters again, so Mommy needs to open the door a crack and leave the hallway light on: <br />
<br />
