<h4 class="byline">HOW TO WIN</h4>

<p>

Yesterday I was having lunch with a colleague and she asked me what it takes to do well in this business. I thought about it for a while, sort of making it up as I went along, and I finally came up with this.<br />
<br />
You need to build two sets of skills.<br />
<br />
One comes from learning all the public records laws and mastering all the interview techniques and skulking down dark alleys and jumping over fences.<br />
<br />
You have to be a detective.<br />
<br />
The other comes from reading all the great books and thinking hard about what makes beautiful writing and practicing and experimenting and never settling for pretty good.<br />
<br />
You have to be a poet.<br />
<br />
You have to be both.<br />
<br />
A poet and a detective.<br />
<br />
You have to be both.
