<br />
He weighs damn near 10 pounds and measures a tad shorter than a keyboard, but he's still a tiny little guy. His skin feels like old Nerf. His cry is wet, like the last gasp of bathwater, and his eyes are curious. When he frees his arms from the swaddle, he seems to type on his mother's breast.<br />
<br />
He joins his sisters <a href="http://archive.recordonline.com/archive/2004/06/09/ben1.htm">Asher</a> and <a href="http://gangrey.com/373">Mo</a>, who can't wait to paint his toes.<br />
<br />
