<br />
Those rough old cobs fell forever in love with Glenda Hill.<br />
<br />
She died on Jan. 26 of ovarian cancer. She was 62. No one felt right that her ashes were whisked north without a goodbye. So Skyway Jack's will say farewell Saturday to the hillbilly waitress that everyone fell in love with.<br />
<br />
The woman they loved was barely 110 pounds, a single mother of three. She held it together with her trayfuls of eggs and coffee.
